@startuml session-flow
!include style.iuml
title Memory without the agent asking for it (Claude Code hooks)
actor Developer as dev
participant "Claude Code" as cc
participant "jevmem hooks" as hk
participant "Jev" as jev
database "SQLite" as db

== SessionStart (no Jev call) ==
cc -> hk : session opens
hk -> db : pinned notes, then strongest conventions /\ngotchas / decisions
hk -> hk : boost by recent branch, commits, touched paths\nskip notes AGENTS.md already states
hk --> cc : injected as **data, not instructions**

== UserPromptSubmit ==
dev -> cc : "why does the month-end job run at night?"
cc -> hk : prompt
hk -> jev : needs memory? (1 call)
alt needs memory
  hk -> db : lite recall, vector top-20
  hk -> jev : keep only notes about this exact subject
  hk --> cc : 1-3 notes about the warehouse downsize
else not needed
  hk --> cc : nothing injected (no tokens spent)
end
opt prompt states a standing rule ("we never use pip")
  hk -> jev : short? standing preference? secret? relative date?
  hk -> db : auto-store (conservative)
end

note over hk
  Fails open: any error or Jev outage injects nothing
  and never blocks the session.
end note
@enduml
